                </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000">
                  <SHORT-NAME>SwPatchVersion</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">&lt;html&gt;
                			 The patch level version number implemented by the supplier for this module is a vendor specific number.
